// Full-tree typecheck for CI: the web app PLUS the dev harness (smoke scripts,
// unit tests) and the bun mini-services. Runs where all per-service deps are
// installed (CI installs them for the smoke suite). `next build` uses the
// narrower tsconfig.json, which checks only the app — see the note there.
//   bunx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.ci.json
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "examples"]
}
